# =========================================================================
# VVDN -- KICH BAN CAT HA CANH XEN KE, 60 PHUT, HUONG 35, MOT PHA, CONG SUAT TOI DA
# 35L ha canh (ILS) / 35R cat canh -- hai duong CHC song song PHU THUOC
# =========================================================================
# Sinh boi _gen_vvdn_1pha_max.py, seed 20261106. Quy tac: vvdn_1pha_max_rules.json + vvdn_xenke_rules.json.
# Quy mo: 23 chuyen den + 23 chuyen di = 46 chuyen dong (+2 tau giu diem cho, khong chay da)
# Co cau: DEN 16 MEDIUM + 7 HEAVY | DI 16 MEDIUM + 7 HEAVY; HEAVY rai deu ca 60 phut
# Loi thoat: HEAVY thoat ly G6 ve ben 8, MEDIUM thoat ly G4 ve ben 28
# Cham banh dau 00:01:35.000, cuoi 00:57:34.580; chay da cuoi 00:58:04.580
# Nhip cham banh TB 152.7 s (nho nhat 138.5, lon nhat 176.8)
#
# PHAN CACH AP DUNG:
#   Cat canh 35R vs tau den ke tiep tren 35L (NM, hang = tau cat canh, cot = tau ha canh): H H=6, H M=7, M H=5, M M=5
#     (tinh tai luc cap huan lenh = chay da - 10 s code C / 15 s code D tro len)
#   Chay da 30 s sau khi tau den cham banh  [CAN XAC NHAN]
#   Ha canh lien tiep 35L: giam sat ATS va nhieu dong theo vvdn_xenke_rules.json
#   Tau ha canh truoc phai thoat ly het khoi 35L (duoi tau qua vach dung cho 35L) truoc khi tau sau toi 2 NM
#   Tau ha canh truoc cat qua het 35R truoc khi tau sau vuot nguong 35L (du thao muc 3)
#   Cat canh lien tiep 35R: theo vvdn_xenke_rules.json; MEDIUM truoc HEAVY cung chang dau 150 s
#   Duong lan E: tau code D/E/F cat canh thi chi tau code C o tren E (du thao muc 3)
#   Diem cho truoc 35R: toi da 3 tau, gom ca tau da len CHC
#
# GIA DINH:
#   Tau den/di dau tien tao giua duong luc 0 de khong co pha khoi dong; khong gio, khong bay lai; ASAS OFF.
#   Tau di bi xoa 420 s sau chay da; tau den bi xoa khi toi ben; pha lan dieu khien bang MOVE nhip 2 s.
#   Khu diem cho trong ngan truoc moi tau di HEAVY: tau HEAVY chi vao duong lan E sau khi tau HEAVY truoc roi CHC.
#
# CANH BAO KHI SINH:
#   (khong co)
# =========================================================================

